  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Optum Public Sector Solutions obligated $19.9B in contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Optum Public Sector Solutions received 30 awards so far in the fiscal year, with an average award size of $664M. Obligations fell 11.5% year over year. Yearly obligations show a multiyear increase from $8.9B in FY21 to a peak of $22.5B in FY25, followed by the current-year decline to $19.9B in FY26. Optum Public Sector Solutions more than doubled obligations between FY21 and FY25, then moved lower in the current fiscal year. The current-year totals are partial and represent fiscal year to date activity, not full-year totals. The company’s award count and large average award size indicate a strategy concentrated in sizable contract vehicles rather than many small procurements. Readers should note the figures are contract obligations except where award-value figures are called out separately in awards tables.",
